note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note FIXTURE for aien-train#19: a seeded, resettable transition micro-world.
note It stands in for Omega X1 ExperienceTransition (omega-mv#699), which is not on
note main. It is not World, J-Space or Cortex evidence. Transitions are executed by
note these fixed dynamics; no model, teacher or corpus generates them.
note Typed finite observation: position p -12..12, velocity v -3..3. Action u -1,0,1.
note Dynamics: p2 = p + v; v2 = v + gain*u + gust. gust is -1 w.p. 1/8, +1 w.p. 1/8, else 0.
note A transition is terminal when p2 leaves -12..12, v2 leaves -3..3, or step 7 ends.
note A terminal transition records its true successor, never the reset state. The next
note transition starts from a fresh reset, so no transition crosses an episode boundary.
note FS slot s occupies FS[16s..16s+15]: 0 gain, 1 env rng, 2 p, 3 v, 4 step, 5 episode,
note 6 reset p low, 7 reset p high, 8 behaviour-policy rng, 9 transitions emitted.
note FT receives one transition: 0 p, 1 v, 2 u, 3 p2, 4 v2, 5 done, 6 episode*16+step.
global FS long 64
global FT long 8

fn fxrand at ulong to long
n = get FS at
n = rem add mul n 1664525 1013904223 4294967296
put FS at n
ret shr n 8
end

fn fxreset s ulong to void
b = mul s 16
lo = get FS add b 6
span = add sub get FS add b 7 lo 1
put FS add b 2 add lo rem fxrand add b 1 span
put FS add b 3 sub rem fxrand add b 1 5 2
put FS add b 4 0
end

fn fxinit s ulong gain long seed long wide long to void
note wide 0: reset p in -12..-4 (training region); wide 1: reset p in -12..12.
b = mul s 16
for i ulong 16
put FS add b i 0
end
put FS b gain
put FS add b 1 seed
put FS add b 6 -12
hi = long -4
if eq wide 1
hi = 12
end
put FS add b 7 hi
put FS add b 8 add seed 7919
fxreset s
end

fn fxact s ulong to long
note Uniform random behaviour policy from its own seeded stream.
ret sub rem fxrand add mul s 16 8 3 1
end

fn fxdone p2 long v2 long step long to long
if or gt p2 12 lt p2 -12
ret 1
end
if or gt v2 3 lt v2 -3
ret 1
end
if ge add step 1 8
ret 1
end
ret 0
end

fn fxvel b ulong v long u long to long
note Successor velocity: v + gain*u + gust, drawn from the environment stream.
r = rem fxrand add b 1 8
v2 = add v mul get FS b u
if eq r 0
ret sub v2 1
end
if eq r 7
ret add v2 1
end
ret v2
end

fn fxstep s ulong u long to void
b = mul s 16
v = get FS add b 3
put FT 0 get FS add b 2
put FT 1 v
put FT 2 u
put FT 3 add get FT 0 v
put FT 4 fxvel b v u
step = get FS add b 4
done = fxdone get FT 3 get FT 4 step
put FT 5 done
put FT 6 add mul get FS add b 5 16 step
put FS add b 9 add get FS add b 9 1
if eq done 1
put FS add b 5 add get FS add b 5 1
fxreset s
else
put FS add b 2 get FT 3
put FS add b 3 get FT 4
put FS add b 4 add step 1
end
end
